        // Observable proxy: after a successful SetMinSum the public MinSum must equal the provided value (1).
        // Therefore the general rule: reverted == (c.MinSum() != 1);
        // If SetMinSum reverted then MinSum should not have been set to 1; if it didn't revert then MinSum must be 1.
