        // Actually reference: SetMinSum reverts if(intitalized) revert(); Initially intitalized==false so first call sets MinSum and does not set intitalized; subsequent calls in reference also allowed unless Initialized() sets flag. To create a distinguishing scenario we MUST call Initialized() between calls in reference to lock setter. The mutant allows subsequent SetMinSum even after Initialized(); reference will revert.

